(7561633, 1212390, 59737, '<td valign="top">interesting in an abstract way, depth of field is too narrow for me giving little for my eye to focus on and draw me in, the darker colors and the purple do that some but the various thorns distract</td>', 'interesting in an abstract way, depth of field is too narrow for me giving little for my eye to focus on and draw me in, the darker colors and the purple do that some but the various thorns distract', '2018-03-04 19:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7561635, 1212300, 59737, '<td valign="top">man with a story to tell, like the framing and placement within the frame, the title works to add some context.  The colors seem overdone to me, maybe too much contrast.  The man''s face seems soft, maybe a big crop or slightly missed focus.</td>', 'man with a story to tell, like the framing and placement within the frame, the title works to add some context.  The colors seem overdone to me, maybe too much contrast.  The man''s face seems soft, maybe a big crop or slightly missed focus.', '2018-03-04 20:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7561636, 1212190, 59737, '<td valign="top">tender moment, eye contact from the boy would have improved this for me and the toy distracts from this image</td>', 'tender moment, eye contact from the boy would have improved this for me and the toy distracts from this image', '2018-03-04 20:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7561637, 1212365, 59737, '<td valign="top">good focus, level horizon and good placement in the frame, the shadows of the trees against the sun is a classic look and you did a good job of capturing the colors of the sky and sun.  Something else to draw the eye would add a lot to this, a person or two in the trees to add something would have boosted this for me.</td>', 'good focus, level horizon and good placement in the frame, the shadows of the trees against the sun is a classic look and you did a good job of capturing the colors of the sky and sun.  Something else to draw the eye would add a lot to this, a person or two in the trees to add something would have boosted this for me.', '2018-03-04 20:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7561638, 1212364, 59737, '<td valign="top">nicely captured moment and good focus, nothing to distract in the background, the out of focus rock in the foreground keeps drawing my eye, I may have cropped this out as it does little to help the image.</td>', 'nicely captured moment and good focus, nothing to distract in the background, the out of focus rock in the foreground keeps drawing my eye, I may have cropped this out as it does little to help the image.', '2018-03-04 20:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7561639, 1211662, 59737, '<td valign="top">very painter like processing  and leaving the open area to the right works well to give the Redcoats a place to march into.</td>', 'very painter like processing  and leaving the open area to the right works well to give the Redcoats a place to march into.', '2018-03-04 20:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7561640, 1212366, 59737, '<td valign="top">great focus, timing and framing, a little room to the left for them to move into would have helped this for me but a strong image.</td>', 'great focus, timing and framing, a little room to the left for them to move into would have helped this for me but a strong image.', '2018-03-04 20:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7561641, 1212218, 59737, '<td valign="top">With the exception of the bird there''s not a lot to hold a viewers attention, a tighter crop that focused more on the bird with less out of focus area would have worked better for me</td>', 'With the exception of the bird there''s not a lot to hold a viewers attention, a tighter crop that focused more on the bird with less out of focus area would have worked better for me', '2018-03-04 20:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
