(7562156, 1212232, 173844, '<td valign="top">This was my top pick.  What great lines, shapes, tones, textures, power and fluidity in the swirling mass of roadways overhead.  A redefinition of the urban sky.  Their stirring movement and music can take your breath away.  And then these three intrepid Ulysseses on motorcycles below bring balance and "purpose" to the image, the opening moment of open adventure.  The complicated patchwork of light and dark are well-served by the choice of black and white presentation.<br/>I''m kind of embarrassed to have shortchanged this fine photo with a measly 8.</td>', 'This was my top pick.  What great lines, shapes, tones, textures, power and fluidity in the swirling mass of roadways overhead.  A redefinition of the urban sky.  Their stirring movement and music can take your breath away.  And then these three intrepid Ulysseses on motorcycles below bring balance and "purpose" to the image, the opening moment of open adventure.  The complicated patchwork of light and dark are well-served by the choice of black and white presentation.I''m kind of embarrassed to have shortchanged this fine photo with a measly 8.', '2018-03-08 08:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
