(7562444, 1212298, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the open challenge well<br/> <br/>Another lovely landscape Otto. As you say, this is a lovely beach, enhanced by the rich reds of the sky and the softness of the long shutter speed. The foreground adds immense interest and balance to the scene, the rugged distant rocky landscape completes a lovely composition beautifully executed as we have come to expect from you. Well done Otto</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the open challenge well Another lovely landscape Otto. As you say, this is a lovely beach, enhanced by the rich reds of the sky and the softness of the long shutter speed. The foreground adds immense interest and balance to the scene, the rugged distant rocky landscape completes a lovely composition beautifully executed as we have come to expect from you. Well done Otto', '2018-03-11 15:04:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7562445, 1212391, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the open challenge well<br/> <br/>Brrr it looks cold! An cool winter landscape made more interesting by the unusual fence that splits the frame into foreground and distant. Good exposure to enhance the whites of the foreground snow, nicely balanced with the complementary darks of the sky, I like the ruggedness of the distant hills, all in all very accomplished Janine, well done</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the open challenge well Brrr it looks cold! An cool winter landscape made more interesting by the unusual fence that splits the frame into foreground and distant. Good exposure to enhance the whites of the foreground snow, nicely balanced with the complementary darks of the sky, I like the ruggedness of the distant hills, all in all very accomplished Janine, well done', '2018-03-11 15:08:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7562447, 1212354, 113591, '<td valign="top">Brilliant picture, wonderful title.</td>', 'Brilliant picture, wonderful title.', '2018-03-11 16:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
